  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHILD RIGHTS AND CHILD PROTECTION IN 20 PR SCHOOLS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHIPO keeps track of the different needs in the schools and has identified 20 schools which are the most needed ones in terms of School facilities such as Water supply, Latrines, and Dinning all with Kitchens. Therefore, if the schools shall have those facilities, health and performance increase shall improve too. Beneficiaries of the projects are Pupils of 9812 Girls and 6894 Boys as well 160 teachers and 480 orphans. Considering the climate change, Water recharge shall be considered.</narrative>
  </description>
